{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"2582","name":"幻影心流","desc":"2.0版本活动 幻影心流","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/20/4521515/91729ac813594a2c4585f111dafa8cdc_5511811327379436834.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"幻影心流","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/20/4521515/0e75a1ab5b472a9f9a769fd0861d783f_6525978916112135444.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1311","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e稻妻的「心流」宗主涉川愿意为有缘的旅人开展幻想的无限制格斗大赛，完成不同难度的挑战后可获得原石等奖励。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e2021/08/20 10:00 ~ 2021/08/30 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥30级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e完成魔神任务「离岛逃离计划」和世界任务「千里之信」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e● 从活动开始的第一天起，每天会开启一个新的挑战。每个挑战有「初传」模式和「奥传」模式。「初传」模式的每个挑战均有「普通」、「困难」、「极限」三个难度。达成较高难度的挑战时，较低难度的挑战会自动达成。「奥传」模式的挑战需要达成「初传」模式的「极限」难度挑战后方能解锁。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e● 每个挑战有至多三个通关条件，必须全部达成才视作通关。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e● 每个挑战都具有独特的「心流机制」，具有特定的效果，留意其效果并善加利用以在挑战中获得助益。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e● 活动期间，世界等级调整不会影响该活动中，敌人的等级与战斗的难度。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e  \u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(190,26,29,1)\\\"\u003e※ 仅可在单人模式下进行「幻影心流」挑战。\u003c/span\u003e     \u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1312","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/4521515/4e2a721d9b200dcbbdc316b58c5d6f65_4718869730372617932.jpg\\\"/\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1313","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动玩法","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/08/18/75276545/a77d20c3bff160296687ac3791df35ad_359487566771056085.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e「幻影心流」活动即将开启！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e稻妻的「心流」宗主涉川愿意为有缘的旅人开展幻想的无限制格斗大赛，参与即有机会获得比赛的奖励~\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e「鸣神纪行」中也增加了对应的活动任务，完成后可领取纪行经验。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/08/18/75276545/fd1dca22f7a6f63aea743eb27ec8287d_8067806135840614292.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(242,90,110,1)\\\"\u003e2021/08/20 10:00 ~ 2021/08/30 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(242,90,110,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥30级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(242,90,110,1)\\\"\u003e且完成魔神任务「离岛逃离计划」和世界任务「千里之信」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓玩法介绍〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/08/18/75276545/83da86afb1c350baec749c78b2574a05_5645833049724919179.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/08/18/75276545/fddda98f6bfb4149af4ff96c8ab22064_8882021495665055331.png?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓注意事项〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e1. 活动期间，旅行者的世界等级调整不会影响活动中敌人的等级与战斗的难度；\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e2. 旅行者\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(242,90,110,1)\\\"\u003e仅可在单人模式下\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e进行「幻影心流」挑战。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动奖励〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e旅行者达成不同难度的挑战后，可以获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(242,90,110,1)\\\"\u003e原石、大英雄的经验、精锻用魔矿、天赋培养素材、摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e等奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/08/18/75276545/8f9d7d35d6d1e994305fe94faf04b2ef_7105723002447808572.jpg?x-oss-process=image//resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1314","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动奖励","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"397\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/4521515/d0cdb40d08651cbfc2d967e0b3391d07_3471654256009480612.jpg\\\" data-ent